do not edit its description/AC or reopen it), since it is a closed, signed ticket.","cohort":["G6"],"criteria":["G6"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.3937,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["arid-gutless-myna is status 'closed' with a signed completion-verifier attestation and a landed comment already present","Plan says 'without rewriting its existing record' but does not specify HOW (comment vs. description edit vs. reopen)","The prior landing note on the same ticket was recorded as a comment — the idiomatic append-only channel"],"finding":"The plan does not name the append-only mechanism for the arid-gutless-myna correction, and that ticket is CLOSED with a signed completion-verifier attestation whose description/AC are immutable. A comment (`rebar comment`) is the only append-only path that leaves the signed record intact; if the implementer instead reopens/edits the description to 'correct' it, that would rewrite the historical record the AC forbids and disturb the signed material. Naming the comment mechanism removes that ambiguity.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ffea4d15b5ee7a1e1","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"Plan bullet 'Append a historical correction to arid-gutless-myna' / AC 'arid-gutless-myna contains an append-only correction'","norm_id":"nfbd7c5be0cdd3aac","priority":0.2063,"reason":"veto:absence-refuted","recalled":false,"scenarios":["An implementer edits the closed ticket's description to insert the correction, mutating immutable historical record and invalidating the append-only intent"],"severity":"major","suggested_fix":"State: 'Record the correction as a comment on arid-gutless-myna (mirroring its existing landing comment); do not edit its description/acceptance criteria or reopen it.'","tier":"LLM","validity":0.375,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"no","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"n